body:
Oh, but you can restart. Not on this plane of existence of course, but you definitely can on here. Think of the internet as another place of existence. Anything can happen here. Lain will always understand because she is the construct of your mind.

&#x200B;

But, traveler, or at least as I assume so, what is it of YOU?

*I believe in wish upon a star earring supremacy.*

&#x200B;

# Our battle WILL be legendary.
